  "changelog": "ESLint package 0.1.0\n\nMinimum Cadencr application version: 0.16.1. This release publishes package assets only. Production marketplace catalog admission, the LSP revocation feed and the desktop release remain separate rollout steps.\n\nCanonical archive and runtime qualification: https://github.com/merkr-software/CadencR/actions/runs/42215738947\n\nRequires an existing Node.js >= 22.0.0. Qualification used Node.js 22.19.0; upstream supported-major restrictions still apply. Cadencr does not install Node.js or resolve project dependencies. The project must supply compatible ESLint dependencies and configuration; they are not installed by this language-server package.\n\n<!-- cadencr-publication-binding:sha256:21f85affeebbfb224ccfb5a8da9e6d36f07c51dd7399e923df22588f9ff4ac73 -->"
